"hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:"
183901,Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah
183902,Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah
184001,"Malik related to me from his paternal uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik from his father that Abu Hurayra said, ""Do you think that it is red like this fire of yours? It is blacker than tar"
184002,"Malik related to me from his paternal uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik from his father that Abu Hurayra said, ""Do you think that it is red like this fire of yours? It is blacker than tar"
